      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WHO'S IDEA (8) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (21.99) at this track behind SPRING HALLIE in a Grade 5. Has the pace to be prominent. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from three attempts. Makes plenty of appeal. BROOKLYN BANDIT (3) has been in super consistent form, finishing in the minors at her last four runs. Last start finished 3rd in a OPEN on May 27 over 352m at this track behind Isle Of Lachlan beaten 2 lengths (19.88). The form out of last race has been strong. Can measure up. RAY'S ATTACK (1) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing seventh (25.85) in a Grade 5 at this track. Solid record at the distance winning six races. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts. Can do much better this time. SING MY SONG (4) is in the mix despite missing out at this track last time.",
